      "content": "hey can u help me write a bit of a script for this new podcast i'm starting? its called \"The Common Sense Truth\" and the whole vibe is just talking about how the elites in DC and big cities are totally out of touch with real people. like, just a short monologue to kick off the first episode about why everything feels so broken right now. nothing too formal, just like a guy talking to his listeners.",
